  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　のどぶくろに　エネルギーをたくわえることができる。いっきに　ほうしゅつして　てきを　ふきとばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "커다란 목 주머니에 에너지를 비축할 수 있다. 단숨에 이를 방출하여 적을 날려 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大大的喉囊裡可以儲存能量。會一口氣釋放出去把敵人轟飛。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon emmagasine de l’énergie dans ses grandes bajoues. Il la libère ensuite d’un coup pour balayer ses adversaires au loin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon kann in seiner großen Wamme Energie speichern. Setzt es diese auf einen Schlag frei, werden dadurch Feinde hinfortgeblasen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Almacena energía en la papada y la libera toda de golpe para arrasar con sus rivales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È in grado di immagazzinare nella grossa sacca giugulare energia che poi rilascia di colpo, spazzando via i nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon can store energy in its large dewlap. Mabosstiff unleashes this energy all at once to blow away enemies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きな　のど袋に　エネルギーを蓄えることができる。一気に　放出して　敵を　吹き飛ばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大大的喉囊里可以储存能量。会一口气释放能量将敌人轰飞。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Almacena energía en la papada y la libera toda de golpe para arrasar con sus rivales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "こどもと　あそぶことが　だいすき。ふだんは　おんこうだが　かぞくをまもるとき　ぎょうそうが　かわる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "아이들과 노는 것을 좋아한다. 평소에는 온화하지만 가족을 지킬 때는 인상이 바뀐다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常喜歡和小孩玩耍。平時性情溫和，但在保護家族時表情會為之一變。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon adore jouer avec les enfants. Il est doux en général, mais lorsqu’il doit protéger sa famille, il prend un air menaçant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon liebt es, mit Kindern zu spielen. Für gewöhnlich ist es friedfertig, doch wenn es seine Familie beschützt, ändert sich das.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encanta jugar con los niños. Normalmente es afable, pero, cuando ha de proteger a su familia, adopta un aspecto amenazante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Adora giocare con i bambini. Di solito è docile, ma quando deve proteggere la sua famiglia assume un’espressione minacciosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mabosstiff loves playing with children. Though usually gentle, it takes on an intimidating look when protecting its family.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "子どもと　遊ぶことが　大好き。普段は　温厚だが　家族を守るとき　形相が　変わる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
